<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 339-6 AT LUNCH V INDIA, 2ND DAY, 2ND TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SOUTH AFRICA 339-6 AT LUNCH V INDIA, 2ND DAY, 2ND TEST.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa were 339 for six at</p>
<p>lunch on the second day of the second test against India on</p>
<p>Friday.</p>
</text>
